<title>UK: UK fair trade office looks at BTR unit sale.</title>
<headline>UK fair trade office looks at BTR unit sale.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK Office of Fair Trading (OFT) said on Friday that it was considering whether BTR Plc's proposed disposal of its Insumat Limited unit to The Weir Group Plc qualifies for investigation under the merger provisions of the Fair Trading Act 1973.</p>
<p>The OFT has invited interested parties to comment on the proposed sale and such representations should be received by 13 September, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
